-- Two columns, each with an oil-free gas cap (Rv primary variable) above an
-- oil zone, so that the true-IMPES weights are formed for cells with different
-- primary variables.  Column 1 (PVT/EQL region 1) has a PVTG table where Bg
-- changes by 15% between Rv = 0 and a saturated Rv of order 1e-7, which gives
-- badly scaled max-abs normalised weights in its gas cap.  Column 2 (region 2)
-- has a regular wet gas table.

